  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">&bull; Brand introduction: <span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">We&rsquo;re a team of Mac lovers. And environment lovers. </span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">We saw the <a href=\"https://www.apple.com/shop/iphone/iphone-upgrade-program\">iPhone Upgrade Program</a> and thought: Why the heck doesn&rsquo;t this exist for Mac?! So we partnered with Citizen's Bank (the same bank that Apple uses) to bring the MacBook Program to life in the U.S.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">&bull; Product description: Our program is simple:</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">- Configure the device you want</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">- Decide whether you would like to upgrade after 24 months or pay until 36 months to keep the device</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">- When the time comes to upgrade, we'll send you a ping to select your next upgrade</span><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">- Your new Mac will arrive with a box for your old one - isntead of sitting on your shelf, we'll do a military-grade wipe on the memory, then find it a new home</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point): Get your new MacBook with low monthly payments and upgrade to a new device after 24 months</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">&bull; Payment terms: 24 months to be eligible for an Upgrade, 36 months to pay off device and keep it</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">&bull; Other information: <br>- We've been live in Scandanavia (Sweden, Finland, Estonia, Denmark, Norway) for the past few years and have over $100 million in sales<br>- Depending on creditworthiness, you could be eligible for 0% APR<br>- We also eventually want to expand so we're not just offering this program for MacBooks, but other things as well.</span></p>\r\n</div>",
